Description: fileutl: process names and open descriptors from libproc
 Darwin has no /proc: GetProcessName() asks proc_name(), and ExecFork()
 lists the descriptors to close with proc_pidinfo(PROC_PIDLISTFDS).
Author: Maxwell <maxwell@blueberrypieos.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-29

